      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJU_mZ1Yz_AzQRPpl8cjf9RAg/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21GTlYyZFNSRTFyZFdwQlVHbE9aMmhXU0hSTVpVRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "8 個月前",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": {
          "text": "我點了一份雞肉蒜蓉意麵和一杯健怡可樂，這明明很簡單，結果他們端上來的是這個。於是我問，我能給我看看雞肉嗎？他們立刻把意麵拿回廚房了。 10分鐘後，他們端上來一塊雞胸肉。我估計他們從開業以來就一直這樣服務顧客，而且他們似乎對這種不誠實的行為毫不在意。哦，對了，還要收10%的服務費…？就為了什麼？就為了倒杯水？這不是最基本的服務嗎？",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Ordered a chicken and garlic linguine and a diet coke, so easy to make and they served me this. So I asked, could you show me the chicken? They took it back to kitchen instantly. 10mins later they came back with a chicken breast on top. I would imagine this is how they serve people since they opened, and they have had no problem treating people with dishonesty. Oh and 10% service charge for…? Nothing? Bringing water to table? Isn’t that just the basics?",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
